control: Delta sync's re-seal moves each credential and client secret to the current key by compare-and-set, and a value someone replaced is read again
removes: every credential is sealed again and written, the ones already on the current key included
packages: ./process/connections
tests: TestReSealingMovesCredentialsToTheCurrentKeyAndTheScanFollows
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

